1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:05,210
There's an interesting one that we saw very recently in a secret report of the State Department.

2
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:08,610
I want to tell you about that one, so you can reflect on that one.

3
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:15,730
That secret report made this point, that Grenada is different to Cuba and Nicaragua.

4
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:22,510
And the Grenada revolution is in one sense even worse, using their language,

5
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:25,690
than the Cuban and Nicaraguan revolutions,

6
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:29,970
because the people of Grenada and the leadership of Grenada speaks English,

7
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:35,030
and therefore can communicate directly to the people of the United States.

8
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:43,510
I can see from your applause, sisters and brothers, that you agree with the report.

9
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:49,850
But I want to tell you what that same report also said,

10
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:54,030
and said that also made us very dangerous.

11
00:00:55,410 --> 00:01:00,890
And that is, that the people of Grenada and the leadership of Grenada are predominantly black.

12
00:01:00,890 --> 00:01:10,130
They said that 95% of our population is black, and they had a correct statistic.

13
00:01:11,230 --> 00:01:17,270
And if we have 95% of predominantly African origin in our country,

14
00:01:17,530 --> 00:01:26,370
then we can have a dangerous appeal to 30 million black people in the United States.

15
00:01:26,370 --> 00:01:56,350
Thank you.

